# Quabricks (QUABRICK.PRG) session on the text shell: sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD quabrick 46 T1 ...
# Shot times (s), the same pictures with and without the blitter:
#   5     the title                         6.5   the setup, starting level 2
#   10.25 two rows cleared (the flash)      11.1  a T turned twice, its ghost
#   16.4  a Quad (flash, message)           17.2  paused (the colours dimmed)
#   22.5  the new record, its name empty    24    the name typed
#   24.8  game over: the Marathon table     26.5  the title with the best score
#   31.5  Time Attack in play               33    the right button's menu
#   37    How to play (over the pause)      41    the high scores: Time Attack (none)
#   42    the high scores: Marathon
# "quabrick -s 1 -q OOOOOTOOOOOOOOII": the pieces from seed 1 after that list.
# the pointer out of the window first (to the screen's bottom right corner)
1000 M 127:127:0:0
+20 M 127:127:0:0
+20 M 127:127:0:0
1500 {esc}
+1500 quabrick -s 1 -q OOOOOTOOOOOOOOII\n
# the title; Enter: the setup; Right (level 2) and back
5500 \n
6000 {right}
7000 {left}
7500 \n
# Marathon, level 1: five O pieces side by side, the last one clears two rows
8000 {left}{left}{left}{left}
8300  
8600 {left}{left}
8800  
9100  
9400 {right}{right}
9600  
9900 {right}{right}{right}{right}
10200  
# a T: turned twice (its ghost below), then held
10600 x
10700 x
11300 c
# eight O pieces: four rows but the last two columns
11600 {left}{left}{left}{left}
11900  
12200 {left}{left}
12400  
12700  
13000 {right}{right}
13200  
13500 {left}{left}{left}{left}
13800  
14100 {left}{left}
14300  
14600  
14900 {right}{right}
15100  
# two long pieces: the second one makes a Quad
15400 {right}{right}{right}{right}
15700  
16000 {right}{right}{right}{right}{right}
16300  
# pause, resume
16800 \n
17500 \n
# hard drops until the well is full: the sweep, then the name of the new record
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
+300 {up}
23000 tester
24500 \n
# the table; Enter: the title (with the best score); the setup: Time Attack
26000 \n
27000 \n
27500 {down}
28000 \n
28500 {left}{left}
29000 x
29500  
30000 {right}{right}{right}
30300  
# the right button's menu over the well, Esc; Esc: the pause
32500 M -120:-120:0:0
+20 M -120:-30:0:0
+100 M 0:0:0:2
+100 M 0:0:0:0
34000 {esc}
34500 {esc}
# Help > How to play (Alt+H, Enter) over the pause; a key: back to the pause; Esc: the title
35500 {dE2}h{uE2}
36000 \n
37500 x
38500 {esc}
# Game > High scores (Alt+G, Down, Down, Enter); Right: Time Attack's table
39500 {dE2}g{uE2}
40000 {down}{down}\n
41500 {right}
42500 {esc}
43500 {esc}
